<section class="problem" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2 id="problem-title">You still check every agent PR by hand</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Coding agents can draft a fix in minutes. Then you spend the rest of the
      hour working out what actually ran.
    </p>
    <div class="scenario-grid">
      <article class="scenario-card">
        <h3>
          The agent says the tests pass. You can't tell which commit it tested,
          or whether CI agrees.
        </h3>
      </article>
      <article class="scenario-card">
        <h3>
          A session dies halfway. You restart it and find a duplicate branch and
          a second PR.
        </h3>
      </article>
      <article class="scenario-card">
        <h3>
          You approved a change this morning. Someone pushed after that, and
          your approval still looks valid.
        </h3>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

